# Database Rules

## Doctype Design
- Use meaningful field names
- Set appropriate field types
- Add proper validation rules
- Use links instead of text for relationships

## Field Types
- Use appropriate field types for data
- Use Link fields for relationships
- Use Dynamic Link for flexible relationships
- Use Table for child records

## Indexing
- Add indexes on frequently queried fields
- Index foreign key fields
- Consider composite indexes for complex queries
- Monitor query performance

## Data Integrity
- Use foreign key constraints
- Implement proper validation
- Handle cascading deletes appropriately
- Maintain referential integrity

## Migrations
- Create patches for schema changes
- Test migrations on staging first
- Document breaking changes
- Provide rollback procedures

## Query Optimization
- Use Frappe's ORM methods
- Avoid N+1 query problems
- Use select fields to limit data
- Implement proper pagination
